### Recruitment Applicants API

@host = http://localhost:4005
@base = {{host}}/api/recruitment/applicants
@id = 000000000000000000000000
@token = <paste_jwt_here>

### Create Applicant
POST {{base}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "phone": "+201001234567",
  "gender": "Male",
  "faculty": "Engineering",
  "academicYear": "3rd Year",
  "selectedTeam": "Project",
  "skills": ["Leadership", "Programming", "Public Speaking"],
  "relevantExperience": "Led a student project team to develop an app.",
  "socialLinks": ["https://linkedin.com/in/johndoe"],
  "dateOfBirth": "2002-05-10",
  "acceptedTerms": true
}

### Get Applicants (list with filters and pagination)
GET {{base}}?page=1&limit=10&selectedTeam=Project&academicYear=3rd%20Year&gender=Male&q=john
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Applicant by Id
GET {{base}}/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update Applicant
PATCH {{base}}/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "selectedTeam": "Digital Marketing",
  "skills": ["Marketing", "Communication"],
  "socialLinks": ["https://twitter.com/johndoe"]
}

### Delete Applicant
DELETE {{base}}/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


